msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Analysis Options"
msgstr "分析オプション"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Here, options for the analysis can be specified."
msgstr "ここで分析のオプションを指定できます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Rotation Method"
msgstr "回転法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Here, the rotation method to apply to the components can be specified. "
"Rotation ensures a simpler understanding of the data structure."
msgstr ""
"ここで成分に適用する回転法を指定できます。回転によってデータの構造が理解しや"
"すくなります。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Orthogonal"
msgstr "直交"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"This method produces components that are uncorrelated. For this method, "
"there are several possibilities that can be selected."
msgstr ""
"この方法では、互いに無相関な成分が得られます。この方法にはいくつかの選択肢が"
"あります。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "none"
msgstr "なし"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "No rotation method is selected."
msgstr "回転法を選びません。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Maximizes the variance of squared loadings for each factor, simplifying "
"interpretations."
msgstr "各因子について負荷量の二乗の分散を最大化し、解釈を単純にします。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimizes the number of factors needed to explain each variable, simplifying "
"structure."
msgstr "各変数を説明するのに必要な因子の数を最小にし、構造を単純にします。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Orthogonal rotation method by Bentler, used for simplifying factor loadings."
msgstr "Bentlerによる直交回転法で、因子負荷量を単純にするために使います。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Combines Varimax and Quartimax to balance factor simplicity and variable "
"explanations."
msgstr ""
"VarimaxとQuartimaxを組み合わせ、因子の単純さと変数の説明のバランスを取りま"
"す。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Applies an orthogonal rotation minimizing a weighted sum of squared loadings."
msgstr "負荷量の二乗の重みつき和を最小にする直交回転を適用します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Oblique"
msgstr "斜交"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"This method produces components that allow for correlation between the "
"components. This method is selected by default. Several possibilities are "
"available. The default is promax."
msgstr ""
"この方法では、成分どうしの相関を許す成分が得られます。既定で選択されていま"
"す。いくつかの選択肢があり、既定はpromaxです。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Starts with Varimax and applies a power transformation to allow correlated "
"factors."
msgstr "Varimaxから始めてべき変換を適用し、因子間の相関を許します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique rotation that minimizes the correlation among factors while "
"allowing flexibility."
msgstr "柔軟性を保ちながら因子間の相関を最小にする斜交回転です。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Aims to simplify factor loadings by minimizing nonzero entries."
msgstr "0でない要素を最小にすることで因子負荷量を単純にすることを目指します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Oblique rotation by Bentler, simplifying factor correlations."
msgstr "Bentlerによる斜交回転で、因子間の相関を単純にします。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique rotation balancing between simple and interpretable factor "
"loadings."
msgstr "単純さと解釈しやすさのバランスを取る斜交回転です。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Targets a cluster rotation for factor analysis, emphasizing group separation."
msgstr "因子分析のクラスタ回転を目指し、群の分離を強調します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"An oblique version of Geomin, allowing factor correlations and reducing "
"complex loadings."
msgstr "Geominの斜交版で、因子間の相関を許し、複雑な負荷量を減らします。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Base Decomposition on"
msgstr "分解の基礎"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "What to base the decomposition of the data into components/factors on."
msgstr "データを成分・因子に分解する際に何を基礎にするかを指定します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Correlation matrix"
msgstr "相関行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The correlation matrix is used to decompose the data into components/factors."
msgstr "相関行列を使ってデータを成分・因子に分解します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Covariance matrix"
msgstr "共分散行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The covariance matrix is used to decompose the data into components/factors."
msgstr "共分散行列を使ってデータを成分・因子に分解します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix"
msgstr "ポリコリック/テトラコリック相関行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"The polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix is used to decompose the data "
"into components/factors. This is sometimes unstable when sample size is "
"small and when some variables do not contain all response categories"
msgstr ""
"ポリコリック・テトラコリック相関行列を使ってデータを成分・因子に分解します。"
"サンプルサイズが小さい場合や、一部の変数にすべての反応カテゴリが現れていない"
"場合、不安定になることがあります"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Factoring Method"
msgstr "因子抽出法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Which factoring method to use for the decomposition."
msgstr "分解に用いる因子抽出法を指定します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum residual"
msgstr "最小残差法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Perform a minimum residual factor analysis (minres) using the first "
"derivative."
msgstr "一次微分を使って最小残差因子分析(minres)を行います。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Maximum likelihood"
msgstr "最尤法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a maximum likelihood factor analysis (ml)."
msgstr "最尤因子分析(ml)を行います。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Principal axis factoring"
msgstr "主軸因子分析"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a principal factor solution (pa)."
msgstr "主因子解(pa)を求めます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Ordinary least squares"
msgstr "通常の最小二乗法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimize the residual matrix using an OLS procedure, slower but uses the "
"empirical first derivative."
msgstr ""
"OLSの手続きで残差行列を最小にします。時間はかかりますが、経験的な一次微分を使"
"います。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Weighted least squares"
msgstr "重み付き最小二乗法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a weighted least squares (WLS) solution."
msgstr "重みつき最小二乗法(WLS)による解を求めます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Generalized least squares"
msgstr "一般化最小二乗法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a generalized least squares (GLS) solution."
msgstr "一般化最小二乗法(GLS)による解を求めます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum chi-square"
msgstr "最小カイ二乗法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"Minimize the sample size-weighted chi-square using pairwise correlations."
msgstr ""
"ペアワイズの相関を使って、サンプルサイズで重みづけしたカイ二乗を最小にしま"
"す。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Minimum rank"
msgstr "最小ランク法"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Perform a minimum rank factor analysis (minrank)."
msgstr "最小ランク因子分析(minrank)を行います。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "出力オプション"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Additional output options for the PCA/EFA analysis."
msgstr "主成分分析・探索的因子分析の追加の出力オプションです。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display loadings above"
msgstr "次を上回る負荷量を表示"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Loadings below this value will not be displayed in the output table."
msgstr "この値を下回る負荷量は出力の表に表示されません。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Order Loadings By"
msgstr "負荷量の並べ方"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Either order the loadings by their size from large to small, or by "
"variables, meaning according to their occurence in the variables list."
msgstr ""
"負荷量を大きさの順に大きいものから小さいものへ並べるか、変数の順、すなわち変"
"数リストに現れる順に並べるかを選びます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大きさ"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display addition tables in the output."
msgstr "出力に追加の表を表示します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Structure matrix"
msgstr "構造行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"An item by factor structure matrix. This is just the loadings (pattern) "
"matrix times the factor intercorrelation matrix."
msgstr ""
"項目×因子の構造行列です。これは負荷量(パターン)行列に因子間相関行列を掛けたも"
"のです。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Component correlations"
msgstr "成分間相関"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Factor correlations"
msgstr "因子間相関"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"When selecting this option, a table with the correlations between the "
"components/factors will be displayed."
msgstr "このオプションを選ぶと、成分・因子どうしの相関の表が表示されます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Additional fit indices"
msgstr "追加の適合指数"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"This option displays the Root Mean Squared Error of Approximation (RMSEA) "
"with 90% confidence interval, the Tucker Lewis Index (TLI), and the Bayesian "
"Information Criterion (BIC) to test the fit of the model."
msgstr ""
"このオプションでは、モデルの適合を検討するために、90%信頼区間つきの"
"RMSEA(Root Mean Squared Error of Approximation)、TLI(Tucker Lewis Index)、"
"BIC(ベイズ情報量規準)を表示します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Residual matrix"
msgstr "残差行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Displays a table containing the residual variances and correlations."
msgstr "残差分散と残差相関を含む表を表示します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Display plots."
msgstr "プロットを表示します。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Path diagram"
msgstr "パス図"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"By selecting this option, a visual representation of the direction and "
"strength of the relation between the variable and factor will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"このオプションを選ぶと、変数と因子の関係の向きと強さを視覚的に表したものが表"
"示されます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Assumption checks"
msgstr "仮定のチェック"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Assumptions: The variables included in the analysis are correlated; the "
"variables included in the analysis are linearly related (Shlens, 2014)"
msgstr ""
"仮定: 分析に含まれる変数は互いに相関している。分析に含まれる変数は線形の関係"
"にある(Shlens, 2014)"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "KMO test"
msgstr "KMO検定"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Determines how well variables are suited for factor analysis by computing "
"the proportion of common variance between variables. Produces a measure of "
"sampling adequacy (MSA) as the proportion of common variance among variables "
"is computed for all variables; values closer to 1 are desired."
msgstr ""
"変数間の共通分散の割合を計算することで、変数が因子分析にどれだけ適しているか"
"を判断します。すべての変数について変数間の共通分散の割合が計算され、サンプリ"
"ング妥当性の指標(MSA)が得られます。値は1に近いほど望ましいとされます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Bartlett's test"
msgstr "Bartlettの検定"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Determines if the data correlation matrix is the identity matrix, meaning, "
"if the variables are related or not. A significant result means the "
"correlation matrix is unlike the identity matrix."
msgstr ""
"データの相関行列が単位行列であるかどうか、つまり変数どうしが関連しているかど"
"うかを判定します。有意な結果は、相関行列が単位行列とは異なることを意味しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Mardia's test"
msgstr "Mardiaの検定"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Assesses the degree of the departure from multivariate normality of the "
"included variables in terms of multivariate skewness and kurtosis. The "
"Mardia's test will always include the listwise complete cases."
msgstr ""
"分析に含まれる変数が多変量正規分布からどれだけ離れているかを、多変量の歪度と"
"尖度によって評価します。マルディアの検定では、常にリストワイズで完全なケース"
"が用いられます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Anti-image correlation matrix"
msgstr "反イメージ相関行列"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Contains the negative partial correlations between pairs of variables after "
"accounting for the effects of all other variables in the dataset. High "
"values in the anti-image correlation matrix indicate that a variable might "
"be redundant or have too much shared variance with other variables."
msgstr ""
"データセット内の他のすべての変数の効果を取り除いたうえでの、変数の対どうしの"
"偏相関に負号を付けたものです。反イメージ相関行列の値が大きい場合、その変数は"
"冗長であるか、他の変数と分散を共有しすぎている可能性があります。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Add PC scores to data"
msgstr "データに成分スコアを追加"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Add FA scores to data"
msgstr "因子得点をデータに追加"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid ""
"Adds the estimated component/factor scores as new columns to the data set. "
"The scores are regression scores."
msgstr ""
"推定された成分得点・因子得点を、データセットに新しい列として追加します。得点"
"は回帰法による得点です。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "接頭辞"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "PC"
msgstr "PC"

msgctxt "PcaEfaOutputOptions|"
msgid "FA"
msgstr "FA"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Data Type"
msgstr "データの種類"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimator\t             "
msgstr "推定法\t             "

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Add factor scores to data"
msgstr "因子得点をデータに追加"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Adds the estimated factor scores as new columns to the data set"
msgstr "推定された因子得点を、データセットに新しい列として追加します"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "接頭辞"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "FS"
msgstr "FS"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "このボックスで、分析の対象とする変数を選びます"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"データが生データ、すなわち行が観測で列が変数の形式か、それとも分散共分散行列"
"かを指定します。後者の場合はサンプルサイズが必要です。"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "このボックスで、分析の対象とする変数を選びます"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"データが生データ、すなわち行が観測で列が変数の形式か、それとも分散共分散行列"
"かを指定します。後者の場合はサンプルサイズが必要です。"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Latent Class Analysis"
msgstr "潜在クラス分析"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Indicators"
msgstr "指標"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Categorical indicator variables for the latent class model. At least two "
"indicators are required."
msgstr ""
"潜在クラスモデルのカテゴリカルな指標変数です。指標は少なくとも2つ必要です。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum number of classes"
msgstr "クラス数の最大値"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Models with 1, 2, …, K classes are fitted and compared."
msgstr "クラス数が1, 2, …, K のモデルをあてはめて比較します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Estimation Options"
msgstr "推定オプション"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of random starts"
msgstr "ランダムな初期値の数"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Number of times the EM algorithm is run with different random starting "
"values. The run with the highest log-likelihood is returned."
msgstr ""
"異なるランダムな初期値でEMアルゴリズムを実行する回数です。対数尤度が最も高く"
"なった実行の結果が返されます。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum iterations"
msgstr "最大反復回数"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Maximum iterations for the EM algorithm."
msgstr "EMアルゴリズムの最大反復回数です。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Missing values"
msgstr "欠測値"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "How to handle rows with missing values on any indicator."
msgstr "いずれかの指標に欠測値がある行をどう扱うかを指定します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "含める"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Listwise deletion"
msgstr "リストごとに削除"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "出力オプション"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Item-response probabilities"
msgstr "項目反応確率"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a table of item-response probabilities for each indicator and latent "
"class."
msgstr "指標と潜在クラスの組み合わせごとに、項目反応確率の表を表示します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a grouped bar chart of item-response probabilities, with one panel per "
"latent class."
msgstr ""
"項目反応確率のグループ化された棒グラフを、潜在クラスごとに1つのパネルで表示し"
"ます。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Rotate x-axis labels 45°"
msgstr "x軸のラベルを45°回転"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Rotate the indicator names on the x-axis by 45 degrees to prevent "
"overlapping."
msgstr "x軸の指標名を45度回転させて、重なりを防ぎます。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Show levels legend"
msgstr "水準の凡例を表示"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a legend on the right indicating the color for each response category "
"level."
msgstr "反応カテゴリの水準ごとの色を示す凡例を右側に表示します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Save to Data"
msgstr "データに保存"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of classes"
msgstr "クラス数"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Which fitted model's results to save."
msgstr "どのモデルの結果を保存するかを指定します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Class probabilities"
msgstr "クラス確率"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Saves K columns of posterior class-membership probabilities (one per class) "
"to the dataset."
msgstr "事後のクラス所属確率をK列(クラスごとに1列)データセットに保存します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Column prefix"
msgstr "列の接頭辞"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Columns are named prefix_C1, prefix_C2, …"
msgstr "列は prefix_C1, prefix_C2, … という名前になります"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Class classification"
msgstr "クラスの分類"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Saves the modal class assignment for each observation as a new nominal "
"column."
msgstr ""
"各観測について、最も確率の高いクラスへの割り当てを新しい名義変数の列として保"
"存します。"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid "Column name"
msgstr "列名"

msgctxt "LatentClassAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Name of the column holding the most-likely class label for each observation."
msgstr "各観測について、最も可能性の高いクラスのラベルを保持する列の名前です。"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "Number of Factors/Components"
msgstr "因子数/成分数"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "欠損値"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Select how to handle missing values."
msgstr "欠測値の扱い方を選びます。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Exclude cases pairwise"
msgstr "ペアワイズでケースを除外"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, all the other variable "
"observations from the same case will still be used for the analysis. In this "
"scenario, it is not necessary to have an observation for all the variables "
"to include the case in the analysis. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ""
"ある変数の観測値が欠測していても、同じケースの他の変数の観測値は分析に使われ"
"ます。この場合、ケースを分析に含めるために、すべての変数について観測値が揃っ"
"ている必要はありません。既定で選択されています。"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "リストごとにケースを除外する"

msgctxt "PcaEfaAnalysisOptions|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, the whole case, so all the "
"other connected variable observations, will be dismissed from the analysis. "
"In this scenario, observations for every variable are needed to include the "
"case in the analysis. "
msgstr ""
"ある変数の観測値が欠測している場合、そのケース全体、つまり関連する他のすべて"
"の変数の観測値も分析から除かれます。この場合、ケースを分析に含めるには、すべ"
"ての変数について観測値が必要です。 "

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Confirmatory factor analysis (CFA) models observed variables (indicators) as "
"manifestations of underlying latent variables (factors). Scale and ordinal "
"variables can be assigned to factors. There is a minimum of one factor, and "
"each factor needs at least two indicators. Add a factor with the (+) button "
"and remove it with the (-) button. A factor can be renamed by changing the "
"name above its assignment box. If any ordinal variable is used, the "
"estimator defaults to DWLS and the test statistic and fit measures are "
"scaled and shifted (mean and variance adjusted, see the lavaan "
"documentation). Other possible estimators are WLS and ULS. With ordinal "
"variables it may make sense to use robust standard errors."
msgstr ""
"確認的因子分析(CFA)は、観測変数(指標)を、背後にある潜在変数(因子)の現れとして"
"モデル化します。因子には間隔・比率尺度の変数と順序変数を割り当てられます。因"
"子は少なくとも1つ必要で、各因子には少なくとも2つの指標が必要です。因子は (+) "
"ボタンで追加し、(-) ボタンで削除します。因子の名前は、割り当てボックスの上に"
"ある名前を変更すると変えられます。順序変数を1つでも使うと、推定法は既定で "
"DWLS になり、検定統計量と適合度指標はスケール化と移動の調整(平均と分散の調"
"整。lavaan のドキュメントを参照)を受けます。ほかに選べる推定法は WLS と ULS "
"です。順序変数を使う場合は、ロバスト標準誤差を使うのが妥当なことがあります。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"データが生データ、すなわち行が観測で列が変数の形式か、それとも分散共分散行列"
"かを指定します。後者の場合はサンプルサイズが必要です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Use raw data with observations as rows and variables in columns."
msgstr "観測を行、変数を列とした生データを使います。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Use a variance-covariance matrix as input. Requires specifying the sample "
"size."
msgstr "分散共分散行列を入力として使います。サンプルサイズの指定が必要です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "The number of observations the variance-covariance matrix is based on."
msgstr "分散共分散行列のもとになった観測の数です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The factors can in turn be indicators of a second-order factor. Any factors "
"not assigned as indicators of the second-order factor are allowed to covary "
"with each other and with the second-order factor, but not with the "
"indicators of the second-order factor."
msgstr ""
"因子をさらに2次因子の指標にすることができます。2次因子の指標として割り当てな"
"かった因子は、互いに、また2次因子と共分散をもつことが許されますが、2次因子の"
"指標との共分散は許されません。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Drag the factors that should be indicators of a second-order factor into "
"this box."
msgstr "2次因子の指標にする因子を、このボックスにドラッグします。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Options for the model specification: mean structure, factor correlations, "
"identification and residual covariances."
msgstr ""
"モデルの指定に関するオプションです。平均構造、因子間相関、識別、残差共分散を"
"扱います。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the means for the indicators and, in the case of multigroup CFA, the "
"means of the latent variables. To identify the model, one of the following "
"constraints needs to be chosen."
msgstr ""
"指標の平均と、多母集団CFAの場合は潜在変数の平均を表示します。モデルを識別する"
"ために、次の制約のいずれかを選ぶ必要があります。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Which intercepts are fixed to zero to identify the model with a mean "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"平均構造をもつモデルを識別するために、どの切片を0に固定するかを指定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fix the latent intercepts (factor means) to zero. The manifest intercepts "
"are estimated freely."
msgstr ""
"潜在変数の切片(因子の平均)を0に固定します。観測変数の切片は自由に推定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fix the manifest intercepts to zero. The latent intercepts (factor means) "
"are estimated freely."
msgstr ""
"観測変数の切片を0に固定します。潜在変数の切片(因子の平均)は自由に推定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fix the mean of the manifest intercepts to zero, which translates to effects "
"coding. The latent intercepts (factor means) are estimated freely."
msgstr ""
"観測変数の切片の平均を0に固定します。これはエフェクトコーディングにあたりま"
"す。潜在変数の切片(因子の平均)は自由に推定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Set the correlations between the different latent variables to 0."
msgstr "異なる潜在変数どうしの相関を0にします。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "How the factors are given a scale. The default is marker variable."
msgstr "因子に尺度を与える方法です。既定はマーカー変数です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The factor has the same scale as its first indicator, because the factor "
"loading of that indicator is fixed to 1."
msgstr ""
"その因子の最初の指標の因子負荷量を1に固定するので、因子はその指標と同じ尺度を"
"もちます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "The factor has a fixed variance of 1."
msgstr "因子の分散を1に固定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "The mean of the factor loadings of a factor is fixed to 1."
msgstr "ある因子の因子負荷量の平均を1に固定します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Allow for covariance between indicators that is not explained by their "
"respective factor, for example because the questions were phrased in a "
"similar way. Drag two variables to the right-side assignment box to let them "
"covary."
msgstr ""
"指標どうしの共分散のうち、それぞれの因子では説明されない部分を許します。たと"
"えば質問の言い回しが似ている場合です。2つの変数を右側の割り当てボックスにド"
"ラッグすると、それらの間に共分散を許します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Pairs of indicators whose residuals are allowed to covary."
msgstr "残差どうしの共分散を許す指標の対です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Fit the CFA model separately for each group of a grouping variable and "
"optionally constrain parameters to be equal across groups."
msgstr ""
"グループ化変数の群ごとにCFAモデルを別々にあてはめます。必要に応じて、パラメー"
"タが群の間で等しいと制約できます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Select a categorical variable here to create CFA models for each group."
msgstr "群ごとにCFAモデルを作るためのカテゴリカル変数を、ここで選びます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Select a level of constraining parameters over the different groups."
msgstr "群の間でパラメータをどの程度まで等しいと制約するかを選びます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "The different groups have the same CFA structure."
msgstr "群どうしで同じCFAの構造をもちます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Same as configural, and the factor loadings are constrained to be equal "
"across groups."
msgstr "「構成」と同じで、さらに因子負荷量が群の間で等しいと制約します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Same as metric, and the means of the indicators (intercepts) are constrained "
"to be equal across groups."
msgstr ""
"「メトリック」と同じで、さらに指標の平均(切片)が群の間で等しいと制約します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Same as scalar, and the residual variances and residual covariances are "
"constrained to be equal across groups."
msgstr ""
"「スカラー」と同じで、さらに残差分散と残差共分散が群の間で等しいと制約しま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Same as strict, and the latent means, variances, and covariances are "
"constrained to be equal across groups."
msgstr ""
"「厳しい」と同じで、さらに潜在変数の平均・分散・共分散が群の間で等しいと制約"
"します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Additional tables with fit measures, assumption checks, validity and "
"reliability measures, covariance matrices, modification indices and the "
"lavaan syntax."
msgstr ""
"適合度指標、前提条件の確認、妥当性と信頼性の指標、共分散行列、修正指数、"
"lavaan の構文を示す追加の表です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the values of various fit measures: incremental fit indices (e.g., "
"CFI, TLI), information criteria (log-likelihood, AIC, BIC, SSABIC) and other "
"measures (e.g., RMSEA with 90% confidence interval, SRMR). Information "
"criteria are only available with ML-type estimators."
msgstr ""
"さまざまな適合度指標の値を表示します。増分適合度指標(CFI、TLI など)、情報量規"
"準(対数尤度、AIC、BIC、SSABIC)、そのほかの指標(90%信頼区間つきの RMSEA、SRMR "
"など)です。情報量規準は、ML系の推定量でのみ利用できます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Determines how well the indicators are suited for factor analysis by "
"computing the proportion of common variance between them. Produces a measure "
"of sampling adequacy (MSA) for each indicator and overall; values closer to "
"1 are desired."
msgstr ""
"指標どうしに共通する分散の割合を計算して、指標が因子分析にどの程度適している"
"かを判定します。指標ごとと全体について標本妥当性の測度(MSA)を出します。値は1"
"に近いほど望ましいとされます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Tests whether the correlation matrix of the indicators is the identity "
"matrix, meaning whether the indicators are related or not. A significant "
"result means the correlation matrix is unlike the identity matrix."
msgstr ""
"指標の相関行列が単位行列であるかどうか、つまり指標どうしが関連しているかどう"
"かを検定します。有意な結果は、相関行列が単位行列とは異なることを意味します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the proportion of variance in each indicator that is explained by "
"all predictors (the factors)."
msgstr ""
"各指標の分散のうち、すべての予測変数(因子)で説明される割合を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the average variance extracted: the amount of variance that is "
"captured by a construct in relation to the amount of variance due to "
"measurement error. Used to evaluate convergent validity."
msgstr ""
"平均分散抽出を表示します。構成概念が捉えている分散の量を、測定誤差による分散"
"の量と比べたものです。収束的妥当性の評価に使います。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the heterotrait-monotrait ratio, a measure of the similarity between "
"latent variables, to assess discriminant validity (Henseler et al., 2015). "
"If the HTMT is clearly smaller than one, discriminant validity can be "
"regarded as established."
msgstr ""
"Heterotrait-monotrait 比を表示します。潜在変数どうしの類似度の指標で、弁別的"
"妥当性を評価するのに使います(Henseler et al., 2015)。HTMT が1より明らかに小さ"
"ければ、弁別的妥当性は確立されたとみなせます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the reliability: the relative amount of test score variance that is "
"explained by the factor(s). Contains coefficient omega (McDonald's) for each "
"indicator group and in total and, if a second-order factor is specified, the "
"omega of the second-order factor. Also provides coefficient alpha "
"(Cronbach's). Note that the total test score variance in the denominator of "
"the reliability equation is the observed test score variance, that is, the "
"summed observed covariance matrix."
msgstr ""
"信頼性、すなわちテスト得点の分散のうち因子で説明される相対的な量を表示しま"
"す。指標のまとまりごとと全体について係数オメガ(McDonald)を示し、2次因子を指定"
"した場合は2次因子のオメガも示します。係数アルファ(Cronbach)も示します。信頼性"
"の式の分母にあるテスト得点の全分散は、観測されたテスト得点の分散、すなわち観"
"測された共分散行列の総和であることに注意してください。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the covariance matrix implied by the model."
msgstr "モデルから導かれる共分散行列を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the covariances between the indicators that remain after taking the "
"model into consideration. A perfect model shows all 0s here."
msgstr ""
"モデルを考慮したあとに残る、指標どうしの共分散を表示します。完全なモデルであ"
"れば、ここはすべて0になります。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display modification indices (MI) above a minimum cutoff. A modification "
"index shows how much the chi-square value of the overall fit would change if "
"the parameter in question were freed up. The expected parameter change (EPC) "
"shows the expected change of the parameter itself."
msgstr ""
"最小のカットオフを上回る修正指数(MI)を表示します。修正指数は、そのパラメータ"
"を自由にした場合に、全体の適合のカイ二乗値がどれだけ変わるかを示します。期待"
"パラメータ変化(EPC)は、そのパラメータ自体の変化の見込みを示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Only modification indices above this value are displayed."
msgstr "この値を上回る修正指数だけを表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display the lavaan model syntax that would be needed to run the model in R."
msgstr ""
"このモデルを R で実行するのに必要な lavaan のモデルの構文を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Plots of the model fit and the estimated model structure."
msgstr "モデルの適合と、推定されたモデルの構造を示すプロットです。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Visually show the residual correlations of the indicators, i.e., the "
"correlations that remain unexplained by the model."
msgstr "指標の残差相関、すなわちモデルで説明されずに残る相関を図で示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Graphically show the estimated model structure."
msgstr "推定されたモデルの構造を図で示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the parameter estimates on the model plot."
msgstr "モデルプロットにパラメータ推定値を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Show standardized parameter estimates on the model plot."
msgstr "モデルプロットに標準化したパラメータ推定値を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Font size of the parameter estimates in the model plot."
msgstr "モデルプロットに示すパラメータ推定値の文字サイズです。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show the means (intercepts) in the model plot. Only available when the mean "
"structure is included."
msgstr ""
"モデルプロットに平均(切片)を表示します。平均構造を含めた場合にのみ利用できま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show the (residual) variances of the indicators and factors in the model "
"plot."
msgstr "モデルプロットに、指標と因子の(残差)分散を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Rotate the model plot by 90 degrees, so that the factors are on the left and "
"the indicators on the right, instead of the factors at the top."
msgstr ""
"モデルプロットを90度回転させ、因子を上に置く代わりに、因子を左、指標を右に置"
"きます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Options for the estimation method, standard errors, missing data handling, "
"and standardization of the parameter estimates."
msgstr ""
"推定法、標準誤差、欠測データの扱い、パラメータ推定値の標準化に関するオプショ"
"ンです。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Emulate the results of different software."
msgstr "異なるソフトウェアの結果に合わせます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the estimation method. The default is ML if only scale variables are "
"used and DWLS if ordinal variables are used. Some estimators set additional "
"options for the test statistic and standard errors in the background. ML-"
"based extensions: MLM (classic robust standard errors, Satorra-Bentler test "
"statistic), MLMV (classic robust standard errors, scaled and shifted test "
"statistic), MLMVS (classic robust standard errors, mean and variance "
"adjusted Satterthwaite-style test statistic), MLF (first-order standard "
"errors, standard test), MLR (Huber-White robust standard errors, Yuan-"
"Bentler T2-star test statistic). Other extensions: WLSM and WLSMV imply DWLS "
"with a scaled or mean and variance adjusted test and robust standard errors, "
"ULSM and ULSMV imply ULS with a scaled or mean and variance adjusted test "
"and robust standard errors. If a method is chosen under Standard errors, it "
"overwrites the standard errors set by the estimator."
msgstr ""
"推定法を選びます。既定は、間隔・比率尺度の変数だけを使う場合は ML、順序変数を"
"使う場合は DWLS です。推定法によっては、検定統計量と標準誤差に関する追加のオ"
"プションが内部で設定されます。ML に基づく拡張: MLM(古典的なロバスト標準誤差、"
"Satorra-Bentler の検定統計量)、MLMV(古典的なロバスト標準誤差、スケール化と移"
"動の調整をした検定統計量)、MLMVS(古典的なロバスト標準誤差、平均と分散を調整し"
"た Satterthwaite 型の検定統計量)、MLF(一次の標準誤差、標準の検定)、MLR(Huber-"
"White のロバスト標準誤差、Yuan-Bentler の T2* 検定統計量)。そのほかの拡張: "
"WLSM と WLSMV は、スケール化した検定または平均と分散を調整した検定とロバスト"
"標準誤差を伴う DWLS を意味し、ULSM と ULSMV は、同じくスケール化した検定また"
"は平均と分散を調整した検定とロバスト標準誤差を伴う ULS を意味します。「標準誤"
"差」で方法を選んだ場合は、推定法で設定された標準誤差よりもそちらが優先されま"
"す。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"How the standard errors of the parameters are computed. If bootstrap is "
"chosen, the confidence intervals are percentile bootstrap confidence "
"intervals."
msgstr ""
"パラメータの標準誤差の計算方法です。ブートストラップを選んだ場合、信頼区間は"
"パーセンタイル・ブートストラップ信頼区間になります。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "The number of bootstrap samples used to compute the standard errors."
msgstr "標準誤差の計算に使うブートストラップ標本の数です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The confidence level of the confidence intervals of the parameter estimates."
msgstr "パラメータ推定値の信頼区間の信頼水準です。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"How missing values are handled. With ordinal variables only listwise "
"deletion and pairwise are available."
msgstr ""
"欠測値の扱い方です。順序変数を使う場合は、リストごとの削除とペアごとの削除だ"
"けを利用できます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Cases with a missing value on any of the indicators are removed from the "
"analysis."
msgstr "いずれかの指標に欠測値があるケースを分析から除きます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The correlations or covariances are computed using all available pairs of "
"observations."
msgstr "相関または共分散を、利用できる観測の対をすべて使って計算します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Full-information maximum likelihood uses all available information of every "
"case."
msgstr "完全情報最尤法では、各ケースの利用できる情報をすべて使います。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"First, the saturated model is estimated with the EM algorithm; then the "
"model is fitted to the estimated means and covariances."
msgstr ""
"まず EM アルゴリズムで飽和モデルを推定し、次に推定された平均と共分散にモデル"
"をあてはめます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Same as two-stage, but with standard errors and test statistic that are "
"robust against non-normality."
msgstr ""
"「二段階」と同じですが、標準誤差と検定統計量が非正規性に対してロバストになり"
"ます。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Display standardized parameter estimates for different standardization "
"schemes."
msgstr "標準化の方式ごとに、標準化したパラメータ推定値を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Display the unstandardized parameter estimates."
msgstr "標準化していないパラメータ推定値を表示します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Standardize based on the variances of the latent variables only."
msgstr "潜在変数の分散だけに基づいて標準化します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Standardize based on the variances of both the observed and the latent "
"variables."
msgstr "観測変数と潜在変数の両方の分散に基づいて標準化します。"

msgctxt "ConfirmatoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Standardize based on the variances of the observed and the latent variables, "
"excluding exogenous covariates."
msgstr "外生共変量を除いた、観測変数と潜在変数の分散に基づいて標準化します。"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of factors"
msgstr "因子数"

msgctxt "ExploratoryFactorAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The number of factors to extract. To determine this number, use the Number "
"of Factors/Components analysis."
msgstr ""
"抽出する因子の数です。この数を決めるには、「因子数/成分数」分析を使ってくださ"
"い。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "In this box, the variables to perform the analysis on are selected"
msgstr "このボックスで、分析の対象とする変数を選びます"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Data"
msgstr "データ"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Specifies whether the data is raw, meaning observations in rows and "
"variables in columns, or whether the data is a variance-covariance matrix. "
"For the latter, the sample size is required."
msgstr ""
"データが生データ、すなわち行が観測で列が変数の形式か、それとも分散共分散行列"
"かを指定します。後者の場合はサンプルサイズが必要です。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Raw"
msgstr "生データ"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Variance-covariance matrix"
msgstr "分散共分散行列"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Sample size"
msgstr "サンプルサイズ"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Analysis Options"
msgstr "分析オプション"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Eigenvalues"
msgstr "固有値"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Settings for the eigenvalues used by the parallel analysis, the eigenvalue "
"criterion and the scree plot."
msgstr "平行分析、固有値基準、スクリープロットに使う固有値の設定です。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Method"
msgstr "方法"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Whether principal component eigenvalues (PC) or factor eigenvalues (FA) are "
"used for the parallel analysis, the eigenvalue criterion and the scree plot. "
"PC-based eigenvalues are a common choice also when the goal is to determine "
"the number of factors for a factor analysis."
msgstr ""
"平行分析、固有値基準、スクリープロットに、主成分の固有値(PC)と因子の固有値"
"(FA)のどちらを使うかを指定します。因子分析の因子数を決めることが目的の場合で"
"も、PC に基づく固有値がよく使われます。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Principal components"
msgstr "主成分"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "因子"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Threshold"
msgstr "しきい値"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Threshold for the eigenvalue criterion: factors/components with an "
"eigenvalue above this value are suggested for retention. The default of 1 "
"corresponds to the Kaiser criterion. The eigenvalue type (principal "
"component or factor eigenvalues) follows the method selected above."
msgstr ""
"固有値基準のしきい値です。固有値がこの値を上回る因子・成分を保持するよう提案"
"します。既定値の1は Kaiser 基準にあたります。固有値の種類(主成分の固有値か因"
"子の固有値か)は、上で選んだ方法に従います。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel Analysis"
msgstr "平行分析"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Parallel analysis compares the eigenvalues of the data to eigenvalues of "
"simulated random data. Factors/components are suggested for retention when "
"their eigenvalue is greater than the 95th percentile of the simulated "
"eigenvalues."
msgstr ""
"平行分析では、データの固有値を、シミュレーションで生成したランダムなデータの"
"固有値と比べます。固有値がシミュレーションによる固有値の95パーセンタイルより"
"大きい因子・成分を保持するよう提案します。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Number of iterations"
msgstr "反復回数"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"The number of random datasets generated for the parallel analysis. The "
"suggested number is based on the 95th percentile of the simulated "
"eigenvalues, which becomes more stable with more iterations."
msgstr ""
"平行分析のために生成するランダムなデータセットの数です。提案される数はシミュ"
"レーションによる固有値の95パーセンタイルに基づき、反復が多いほど安定します。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Correlation Matrix"
msgstr "相関行列"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Which type of correlation matrix the analysis is based on."
msgstr "分析のもとにする相関行列の種類です。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Pearson"
msgstr "ピアソン"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "The Pearson correlation matrix is used."
msgstr "ピアソンの相関行列を使います。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Polychoric/tetrachoric"
msgstr "ポリコリック/テトラコリック"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"The polychoric/tetrachoric correlation matrix is used. This is sometimes "
"unstable when sample size is small and when some variables do not contain "
"all response categories"
msgstr ""
"ポリコリック/テトラコリック相関行列を使います。サンプルサイズが小さい場合や、"
"反応カテゴリの一部が現れない変数がある場合は、不安定になることがあります"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Missing Values"
msgstr "欠損値"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Select how to handle missing values."
msgstr "欠測値の扱い方を選びます。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Exclude cases pairwise"
msgstr "ペアワイズでケースを除外"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, all the other variable "
"observations from the same case will still be used for the analysis. In this "
"scenario, it is not necessary to have an observation for all the variables "
"to include the case in the analysis. This option is selected by default."
msgstr ""
"ある変数の観測値が欠測していても、同じケースの他の変数の観測値は分析に使われ"
"ます。この場合、ケースを分析に含めるために、すべての変数について観測値が揃っ"
"ている必要はありません。既定で選択されています。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Exclude cases listwise"
msgstr "リストごとにケースを除外する"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"If one observation from a variable is missing, the whole case, so all the "
"other connected variable observations, will be dismissed from the analysis. "
"In this scenario, observations for every variable are needed to include the "
"case in the analysis. "
msgstr ""
"ある変数の観測値が欠測している場合、そのケース全体、つまり関連する他のすべて"
"の変数の観測値も分析から除かれます。この場合、ケースを分析に含めるには、すべ"
"ての変数について観測値が必要です。 "

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Output Options"
msgstr "出力オプション"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis table"
msgstr "平行分析の表"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a table with the real data eigenvalues and the mean eigenvalues of "
"the simulated data. Factors/components suggested for retention are marked "
"with an asterisk."
msgstr ""
"実データの固有値と、シミュレーションデータの固有値の平均を示す表を表示しま"
"す。保持するよう提案された因子・成分にはアスタリスクが付きます。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "MAP table"
msgstr "MAP の表"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a table with the average squared partial correlation after "
"partialling out 0, 1, 2, ... principal components (Velicer's minimum average "
"partial test). The number of components with the lowest value is suggested "
"for retention and marked with an asterisk. This suggestion is always shown "
"in the summary table. It is based on principal components, independent of "
"the method selected under Eigenvalues."
msgstr ""
"主成分を 0, 1, 2, ... 個統制したあとの偏相関の二乗の平均を示す表を表示します"
"(Velicer の最小平均偏相関(MAP)検定)。値が最も小さくなる成分数を保持するよう提"
"案し、アスタリスクを付けます。この提案は要約の表につねに示されます。固有値で"
"選んだ方法にかかわらず、主成分に基づきます。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Scree plot"
msgstr "スクリープロット"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Displays a scree plot. The scree plot provides information on how much "
"variance in the data, indicated by the eigenvalue, is explained by each "
"factor/component. The horizontal line marks the eigenvalue threshold."
msgstr ""
"スクリープロットを表示します。スクリープロットは、データの分散のうち各因子・"
"成分がどれだけを説明しているかを、固有値によって示します。水平線は固有値のし"
"きい値を示します。"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid "Parallel analysis results"
msgstr "平行分析の結果"

msgctxt "NumberOfFactors|"
msgid ""
"Display the mean eigenvalues of the simulated data from the parallel "
"analysis in the scree plot."
msgstr ""
"平行分析で得たシミュレーションデータの固有値の平均を、スクリープロットに表示"
"します。"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid "Number of components"
msgstr "成分数"

msgctxt "PrincipalComponentAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"The number of components to extract. To determine this number, use the "
"Number of Factors/Components analysis."
msgstr ""
"抽出する成分の数です。この数を決めるには、「因子数/成分数」分析を使ってくださ"
"い。"

#. Shown at the top of the analysis options when a JASP file made with an older version is opened. "Number of Factors/Components" is an analysis name in the Factor menu, translate it the same way there.
msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"Parallel analysis, the eigenvalue criterion, the parallel analysis table and "
"the scree plot have moved to the new <b>Number of Factors/Components</b> "
"analysis in the Factor menu. The number of components is now always entered "
"manually here, so please check that it is still correct."
msgstr ""
"平行分析、固有値基準、平行分析の表、スクリープロットは、「因子」メニューにあ"
"る新しい <b>因子数/成分数</b> 分析に移りました。成分の数は、ここではつねに手"
"で入力するようになったので、今の値が正しいかを確認してください。"

msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"This number used to be determined automatically; please check that it is "
"still what you want."
msgstr ""
"この数は以前は自動で決まっていました。今の値が望みどおりかを確認してくださ"
"い。"

#. Shown at the top of the analysis options when a JASP file made with an older version is opened. "Number of Factors/Components" is an analysis name in the Factor menu, translate it the same way there.
msgctxt "Upgrades|"
msgid ""
"Parallel analysis, the eigenvalue criterion, the parallel analysis table and "
"the scree plot have moved to the new <b>Number of Factors/Components</b> "
"analysis in the Factor menu. The number of factors is now always entered "
"manually here, so please check that it is still correct."
msgstr ""
"平行分析、固有値基準、平行分析の表、スクリープロットは、「因子」メニューにあ"
"る新しい <b>因子数/成分数</b> 分析に移りました。因子の数は、ここではつねに手"
"で入力するようになったので、今の値が正しいかを確認してください。"
